.Dd August 16, 2026
.Dt PROBE 4
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm probe
.Nd sample driver with every man nit this decree knows
.Sh SYNOPSIS
To compile this driver into the kernel,
place the following lines in your
kernel configuration file:
.Bd -ragged -offset indent
.Cd device probe
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver attaches to sample devices found on Mac computers.
.Pp
It arms wake on shutdown
.Pq e.g. Va dev.probe.N.wake=1 .
.Sh HARDWARE
The
.Nm
driver supports:
.Bl -tag -width "WIDGET9876" -compact
.It WIDGET9876
Sample widget, present on later machines
.Pq 2018 and later.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr acpi 4
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
driver first appeared in
.Fx 16.0 .
